{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc 'rg -n \"fold_advances_evaluation_poly|advances_evaluation|fold.*evaluation\" Arena/Binius_BinaryBasefold_fold_advances_evaluation_poly.lean .lake/packages/arklib/ArkLib .lake/packages/CompPoly/CompPoly'","aggregated_output":"Arena/Binius_BinaryBasefold_fold_advances_evaluation_poly.lean:797:/-- **Lemma 4.9.** The iterated fold equals the localized fold evaluation via matmul form -/\nArena/Binius_BinaryBasefold_fold_advances_evaluation_poly.lean:813:theorem fold_advances_evaluation_poly\n.lake/packages/CompPoly/CompPoly/Fields/Binary/AdditiveNTT/Correctness.lean:855:      unfold x0 cur_evaluation_point\n.lake/packages/CompPoly/CompPoly/Fields/Binary/AdditiveNTT/Correctness.lean:1017:      unfold x1 cur_evaluation_point\n.lake/packages/arklib/ArkLib/ProofSystem/Binius/BinaryBasefold/Prelude.lean:797:/-- **Lemma 4.9.** The iterated fold equals the localized fold evaluation via matmul form -/\n.lake/packages/arklib/ArkLib/ProofSystem/Binius/BinaryBasefold/Prelude.lean:815:theorem fold_advances_evaluation_poly\n.lake/packages/CompPoly/CompPoly/Fields/Binary/AdditiveNTT/Algorithm.lean:57:  unfold evaluationPointω twiddleFactor\n.lake/packages/CompPoly/CompPoly/Fields/Binary/AdditiveNTT/NovelPolynomialBasis.lean:1124:  -- Unfold the definition of kernel membership and polynomial evaluation.\n.lake/packages/CompPoly/CompPoly/Fields/Binary/AdditiveNTT/NovelPolynomialBasis.lean:1281:  -- Unfold the definition of kernel membership and polynomial evaluation.\n.lake/packages/arklib/ArkLib/Commitments/Functional/Hachi/QuadEval/Gadgets.lean:47:  folding-based polynomial-evaluation protocol; this file is its gadget layer.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
